  "title": "From Spreadsheets to Success: Transforming Real Estate Portfolio Management",
  "summary": "For years, real estate asset owners relied on spreadsheets as the backbone of portfolio management. Spreadsheets provided a flexible solution to track expenses, plan capital expenditures (CapEx), and project long-term performance. But as portfolios grow, so does the complexity of managing them. Increasingly, spreadsheets reveal their limitations, from tracking issues to data entry errors that could compromise asset performance and reduce returns.",
